# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# What the-builder says (string gap, group 2). Every line it prints is one of
# these: its dcterms:description is a Mustache template, and the code names
# the message by its IRI and fills the named slots. The code never spells a
# message. Until the model is loaded, a message prints as its own IRI.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
<https://drift-king.org/the-builder/messages>
    a skos:ConceptScheme ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://drift-king.org/ah/the-builder> ;
