<https://drift-king.org/the-builder/name/rule> dcterms:references <https://drift-king.org/the-builder/queries/subject-rule.rq> .
<https://drift-king.org/the-builder/name/class> dcterms:references <https://drift-king.org/the-builder/queries/subject-rule.rq> .
<https://drift-king.org/the-builder/name/subject> dcterms:references <https://drift-king.org/the-builder/queries/subject-rule.rq> .
